cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this benchmark when using its dataset, interface or evaluation protocol."
type: software
title: "Ashebo CounterflowBench: A Radial Hamiltonian and Heat-Production Benchmark for Physics AI"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Ashebo
    given-names: Yohannes Beyene
    affiliation: Ashebophysics
repository-code: "https://github.com/YohannesAshebo/yohannes-ashebo-rgt-hamiltonian"
url: "https://github.com/YohannesAshebo/yohannes-ashebo-rgt-hamiltonian/tree/main/ai_benchmark"
abstract: >-
  An additive finite-grid synthetic physics-AI benchmark with 50 radial
  counterflow trajectories, seed-group train/validation/test splits, canonical
  Hamiltonian gradients, conservative and dissipative operators, heat labels,
  native energy/content audits and a trained known-H heating surrogate.
keywords:
  - physics AI
  - scientific machine learning
  - Hamiltonian neural networks
  - dissipative dynamics
  - neural operators
  - reproducible benchmark
